{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05735","headline":"惠文太子挽歌 · 袁瓘","name":"惠文太子挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒仗丹旄引，阴堂白日违。\n暗灯明象物，画水湿灵衣。\n羽化淮王去，仙迎太子归。\n空余燕衔土，朝夕向陵飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}